## Security Checklist

- [ ] Validate all user inputs (use Zod schemas)
- [ ] Sanitize data before rendering (prevent XSS)
- [ ] Use HTTPS for API communication
- [ ] Store tokens in `httpOnly` cookies (not localStorage)
- [ ] Implement CSRF protection
- [ ] Set secure headers (via backend)
- [ ] Implement rate limiting (via backend)
- [ ] Never expose API keys in frontend code
- [ ] Use environment variables for configuration
- [ ] Implement proper error messages (no sensitive data leaks)

