## Critical Rules Summary

### ALWAYS

1. Use service layer for API calls
2. Use Tailwind theme tokens for colors (see `styles.mdc`)
3. Type all props and state
4. Follow styling rules from `styles.mdc`
5. Keep table font-weight constant on hover (no layout shift)
6. Use `@/` path alias for imports
7. Validate environment variables on startup
8. Use shadcn/ui components as base primitives

### NEVER

1. Hardcode API URLs or secrets
2. Use `any` type without justification
3. Mutate state directly
4. Call axios from components
5. Change font-weight on table hover
6. Commit console.log statements
7. Skip error handling in async functions
8. Use inline styles instead of Tailwind classes
9. Hardcode colors without dark mode support

